Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 23:19:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 38/71] Report the part of the bill no filter explains

The trailer priced each mechanism against the log's own arithmetic, so a
request the log never saw was simply absent and every share was measured
against the wrong denominator. Compare the rows to the provider's own session
total, and price the compaction summariser, which builds its prompt outside the
turn loop and is never cached.

Also name the requests that reported an untouched prefix and were charged full
price regardless. No filter did that, so the report cannot see it, and it is
where the money actually goes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
